  "Scenes.Farm.CowBadEnd2.SloshBackIntoBarn": "A day later, you slosh back into the barn with your breasts painfully full and ready to be emptied. Your cum-filled belly joins your tits in dragging on the floor while you daydream about your time in the minotaur caves last night. The first one claimed your [asshole], brutalizing it over and over while the beast emptied his vast reservoirs of seed into your rectum. Before the beast's equine-like cock could be stuffed halfway inside you, a slightly smaller minotaur was in front of your face, smearing your lips with a thick coating of his tasty pre. Like a good cow, you opened wide for the bull and gratefully accepted his thick loads, feeling the narcotic-like spunk shut down your ability to think about anything but sex.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.ClearYourThoughts": "Shaking your head, you clear your thoughts and turn away from the pasture. Cows don't have your problems."
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.CowPasture": "Your explorations take you to the cow pasture. There's no bull here, so the cows are all placidly grazing, building up milk for Whitney to gather. One turns to face you, and you get the odd feeling that it's trying to tell you something.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.EmbracingOpenAir": "Embracing the open air, you speed your [walk] into [if (!isbiped) {{something of }}]a brisk jog. The swift [if (istaur) {{gallop|journey}}] in the dark is soothing to an extent, free from the hustle and bustle of the working day.[if ({0}) {{ Your peace of mind is disturbed as you notice the glare of Kelt, with his bow ready in hand. Fortunately, he recognizes you before loosing an arrow in your direction. He continues his trot, saying nothing.}}]"
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.EvenlyMatched": "Whitney and you are evenly matched, and the two of you run together for a while, each pushing yourself harder in an effort to best the other."
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.ItDisgustsYou": "It disgusts you."
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.ItMakesYouSmile": "It makes you smile."
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.LieBackPanting": "[pg]Afterwards, the both of you lie back against a tree, panting heavily and exchanging pleasantries. Once you've both had a chance to rest, she bids you farewell and returns to her labors, leaving you to journey home to camp."
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.MaybeSheWantsMilked": "[say: Maybe she wants to be milked?] you think. You certainly do.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.MaybeWantsABull": "Maybe it wants a bull? You do, one with long, thick dick-meat to satisfy your starving fuck-hole...[pg]"
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.NotSureHowFeel": "You aren't sure how you feel about that."
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.NothingEntertaining": "You wander around, unable to find anything entertaining on this patch of rural bliss."
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.RunAroundFarm": "You run around the farm, keeping an eye for any monsters or oddities around Whitney's property. Eventually the she-dog joins you, and the two of you have a good time pushing your speed to its limits. "
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.SleepingCows": "You happen upon some sleeping cows as you explore, all seeming quite at peace, their bodies rising and falling so slightly as they breathe."
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.UnbiddenNotion": "Unbidden, the notion that a cow-slit would probably feel pretty good wrapped around your horse-prick flickers through your mind. "
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.WanderAtopRiseDay": "After wandering around for a while, you find yourself atop a slight rise looking out over the farm and the distant lake. Despite the corruption you know is slowly consuming this land, being here now makes you feel so at peace you wish it could go on forever."
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.WanderAtopRiseNight": "After wandering around for a while, you find yourself atop a slight rise looking out over the farm and the distant, faintly shimmering lake. Settling in, you let yourself absorb the view, unperturbed by the corrupt creatures that would pounce were you to rest in most places this late. "
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.WhitneyFallsBehind": "Whitney falls behind, unable to cope with your speed as you tear around the farm."
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.WhitneyOutpaces": "Whitney easily outpaces you, leaving you so far behind that she laps around the farm twice for each pass you make."
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.WhitneyStillFaster": "Whitney is still faster than you, and manages to get far enough ahead of you to disappear from time to time."
  "Scenes.Farm.ExploreFarm.WouldGetPitchfork": " It for certain would get Whitney chasing you off with a pitchfork.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.AfterSeveralVisits": "After several visits the friendly farm, you're confident that you can now consistently find your way there without needing to stumble upon it by luck again.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.AfterWhatDidKelt": "[pg][say: What the fuck do you think you're doing here [name]? After what you did to Kelt you still think you're welcome here? Leave. <b>Now</b>.]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.AfterWhatDidMarble": "[pg][say: What the fuck do you think you're doing here [name]? After what you did to Marble you still think you're welcome here? Leave. <b>Now</b>.]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.FarmAddedToPlaces": "<b>(\"Farm\" added to Places menu.)</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.FarmerIsAWoman": "[pg]You [if (days<4) {{do your best to conceal your surprise as you realize|glance them up and down to see that}}] the farmer is a woman with {0}. She giggles happily and beckons you over. [say: Welcome [if (isChild) {{young'n|stranger}}], it sure is pleasant to see a new face 'round here. My name's Whitney, and [if (isChild) {{you're mighty lucky wanderin' my way|it's mighty fine I don't have to pitchfork you like most guests}}]!] She fills you in about the lake and her farm, telling you how the demons can't seem to stay close for long, and monsters always seem weaker the few times they have approached. Whitney catches herself rambling and rapidly changes subject. [say: I've got to get back to work, but you help yourself to the peppers, hun[if (isChild) {{--I won't go letting a nice young kid starve out there}}]!][pg]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.HandsUpKilledKelt": "[pg]You hold your hands up, knowing full-well what the angry bitch is on about. She angrily says [say: You've fucking killed Kelt! He may be rude and I don't like him but still, what you've done is wrong. You're not welcome on my farm anymore! Leave. <b>Now.</b>]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.HoldHandsUpTarnation": "[pg]You hold your hands up, knowing full-well what the angry bitch is on about. [say: I didn't do anything he wouldn't have done to me.]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.LakesideStrollSpot": "Along your lakeside stroll, you spot what appears to be a house further from the water, surrounded by fields of, presumably, crops. As you near the edge of the farm, the slight scent of vegetation catches your attention. Surveying the place, you figure whoever lives here is in the house and preparing for bed, if not already sleeping. [if (hunger >= 65) {Your stomach growls in distress|The thought of what you'll be doing for food in the morning rolls in your mind}] as you shift your gaze to the nearest patch. With all they've got growing here, you doubt they'd notice you stealing a little."
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.MarchesUpKelt": "Whitney marches up to you as soon as you approach the farm, a stoic expression plastered across her face."
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.MarchesUpMarble": "Whitney marches up to you as soon as you approach the farm, a stoic expression plastered across her face."
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.NotWelcomeOnFarm": "You aren't welcome on the farm proper, but you can see Kelly cantering about the fields, looking for you."
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.QuaintFarmhouse": "You find a quaint farmhouse on the far shores of the lake[if ({0}) {{, recognizing it from the other night}}]. Around the homestead are a range of gardens, filled with delicious fruits and vegetables. Your belly rumbles, [if (hunger >= 65) {{aching with hunger|tantalized by the sights and scents}}], as you approach the dwelling. A figure in a pepper patch rises up to greet you, waving you over."
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.SpinsAboutTrotsBack": "[pg]She spins about and trots back to her farm, picking up a pitchfork as she goes. It looks like you won't have access to the farm any more, at least until you come up with a way to deal with Whitney."
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.StartsToGrowl": "[pg]Whitney starts to growl before catching herself and folding her arms across her chest. [say: I reckon you don't need to be nosing around my farm anymore, but since 'Kelly' seems to need you, I'll let her go out to visit you when you come calling. Just stay away from the rest of us.]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.StormingUpKilledKelt": "As soon as you approach the farm, Whitney comes storming up to meet you. [say: What the fuck have you done?!]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.StormingUpTarnation": "As soon as you head to the farm, Whitney comes storming up to meet you. [say: What in tarnation do you think you're pulling?!]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.StumbleAcrossFarm": "You stumble across Whitney's farm again. The {0} woman gives you a friendly wave and tosses you another Canine pepper.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmExploreEncounter.WhitneyFumes": "[pg]Whitney fumes, [say: You might be right on that count, but the difference is that Kelt didn't keep coming to you to do it. I don't much like him.] Whitney spits for emphasis before continuing, [say: But I felt bad enough for him to let him stick around, so long as he left me an' everybody else well enough alone. The boy's got... an aura or something, and sure, you likely would've wound up like he is.] She glares back at the farm for emphasis. [say: But only if you enjoyed it enough to keep hanging around the dipstick. You... you just kept hounding him... drugging him with them demon fluids over and over. The poor thing can barely sleep without whimpering after your dick.]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmMenu.AlthoughSunAbsent": "Although the light of the sun is absent, you can make out the broad strokes enough to get around. The farm may be large, but it is simple to navigate. "
  "Scenes.Farm.FarmMenu.ManyPlotsCrops": "Many plots filled with crops surround the humble homestead that overlooks the lake. Various other structures also dot the land--such as the barn, which has its own forge behind it for repairing tools. Housing for animals faces the more open, otherwise unused land, making it easy to let livestock out to graze. Whitney's farm is remarkably large for such a humble operation. What do you want to do?"
  "Scenes.Farm.FindStables.ExplainWandering": "[pg]You explain you were just wandering and curiously checked out the stables. Horses seem like quite the investment to feed and care for in world ravaged by demon conquest. Whitney shrugs, [say: They can pull a cart of produce and be better than walking on foot much of the time.]"
  "Scenes.Farm.FindStables.FairEnoughHorses": "[pg]Fair enough. If she finds reason to care for and raise horses, they must be worth having. Though perhaps part of it may be keeping them away from corruption, you figure. Maybe Whitney could let you ride around on one sometime?"
  "Scenes.Farm.FindStables.LetMeKnowSometime": "[pg][say: Maybe. If you're really interested, let me know some other time and we can probably have a whack at it,] she says, setting her attention back at the task at hand. You take it as your cue to leave."
  "Scenes.Farm.FindStables.SpotStables": "While [walking] around the farmhouse, you spot what appears to be stables. You're already familiar with the milking barn, thus this building must be for something other than cows. Whitney <i>does</i> have horses then! Either that, you figure, or centaurs have a very low standard for on-site living conditions. Ever prone to explore, you prance right in."
  "Scenes.Farm.FindStables.StablesSmellMusk": "[pg]The stables immediately smell of equine musk and animal filth as you enter. Coincidentally, Whitney is also in here at the moment. The dog-morph quickly notices you and pipes up. [say: Howdy there, [name], {0} What brings you here?]"
